---
title: "Figure 3.X. Patient Side Process Flow"
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open DermaTrack]
    B --> C{Does the patient\nhave an account?}

    C -- No --> D[Register Account]
    D --> E{Are registration\ndetails valid?}
    E -- No --> D
    E -- Yes --> F[System Creates Account]
    F --> G[Login]

    C -- Yes --> G

    G --> H{Are login\ncredentials valid?}
    H -- No --> G
    H -- Yes --> I[Open Patient Dashboard]

    I --> J[Patient Updates Profile\nand Medical History\n&#40;Optional&#41;]
    J --> K[Patient Selects Scan Option]
    K --> L{Choose Image\nInput Method}
    L -- Capture Image --> M[Capture Image via Camera]
    L -- Upload Image --> N[Upload Image from Device]
    M --> O[System Checks\nImage Requirements]
    N --> O

    O --> P{Is the image\nacceptable?}
    P -- No --> Q[Request Retake\nor Re-upload]
    Q --> L
    P -- Yes --> R[Submit Image for\nAcne Assessment]

    R --> S[System Sends Image to\nAcne Detection and\nClassification APIs]
    S --> T[System Receives Severity\nResult and Lesion Information]
    T --> U[System Displays Severity Label,\nAcne Counts, Region,\nand Notes Area]
    U --> V{Does the patient\nwant to save\nthe scan?}

    V -- No --> W[Patient Discards Result]
    W --> Z1([End])

    V -- Yes --> X[Save Scan Record]
    X --> Y[Patient Views Scan History]
    Y --> AA{Does the patient\nwant to generate\na report?}

    AA -- Yes --> AB[Generate Report]
    AB --> AC{Does the patient want\nto consult or share\nwith a dermatologist?}
    AA -- No --> AC

    AC -- No --> Z2([End])
    AC -- Yes --> AD[Share Scan or Report\nwith Dermatologist]
    AD --> AE[Patient Sends Message\nto Dermatologist\n&#40;Optional&#41;]
    AE --> AF{Is there a\ndermatologist\nresponse available?}

    AF -- No --> AG[Show Pending or\nNo Response Status]
    AG --> Z3([End])
    AF -- Yes --> AH[Patient Views Dermatologist Note,\nPrescription, Treatment Plan,\nor Message]
    AH --> Z4([End])

    style A fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z1 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z2 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z3 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z4 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style C fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style E fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style H fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style L fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style P fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style V fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style AA fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style AC fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style AF fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
